              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Gambira Abaisraeli oti: Omushaija nari omukazi ku arihiga okuhiga okutari kw'obutoosha okw'Omunaziiri, naaraganisa kweshoroorera MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayetaanise na viinyo n'eky'okunywa ky'amaani, atarinywa viinyo erikushaarira, nari eky'okunywa ky'amaani kyona ekirikushaarira, n'obu kwakuba okunywa eky'okunywa kyona ekirikuruga omu mizaabibu, nari okurya ebijuma byayo ebibisi nari ebyomire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro byona ebi arimara omu bunaziiri atarirya ekintu kyona ekirikuruga omu muzaabibu, okuruga aha mbibo zaayo okuhika aha kishushu kyayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
