        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 21:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eki nikyo kiragiro ky'Omunaziiri, ebiro by'obunaziiri bwe ku birihwa. Aryareetwa aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahongyere MUKAMA empongano ze, empaya nto y'entaama emwe ehikize omwaka etaine kamogo kuba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, omwagazi gw'entaama gumwe oguhikize omwaka ogutaine kamogo kuba ekitambo ky'ekibi, empaya y'embuzi emwe etaine kamogo kuba ekitambo ky'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 29:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ekiibo ky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe otukeeki tw'esaano y'obunono ejwangize n'amajuta, na capati ezitatumbisiibwe ezisiigirwe amajuta, hamwe n'empongano zaabyo z'esaano n'ez'eby'okunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyamurwa abimurikye omu maisho ga MUKAMA, amuhongyerere ekitambo kye ky'ekibi n'eky'okwotsya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ahongyere MUKAMA egyo mpaya y'entaama kuba ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, abihongye n'ekiibo ky'egyo migaati etatumbisiibwe; kandi omunyamurwa ahongye empongano zaabyo ez'esaano n'ez'eby'okunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 21:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Obwo ogwo Munaziiri amwe eishokye aha mutwe gwe ogw'obunaziiri, arimwere aha muryango gw'Eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, atware eryo ishokye ry'aha mutwe gwe ogw'obunaziri, arite aha muriro oguri ahansi y'ekitambo ky'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyamurwa atware ekivune ky'omukono ky'egyo mpaya y'entaama kiteekire, aihe akakeeki kamwe akatatumbisiibwe omuri ekyo kiibo, na capati emwe etatumbisiibwe, abite omu ngaro z'ogwo Munaziiri, yaaheza kumwa eishokye ry'aha mutwe gwe ogw'obunaziiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 35:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omunyamurwa abizongazonzye omu maisho ga MUKAMA; bibe omugabo gw'omunyamurwa ogurikwera, hamwe n'enkoro ezongazongiibwe n'ekivune ky'okuguru ekihongirwe. Ebyo ku birihwa, Omunaziiri abone kunywa viinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo nikyo kiragiro ky'Omunaziiri orikuhiga, n'eky'empongano ezi arihongyera MUKAMA ahabw'obunaziiri bwe, otabariiremu ebi arikubaasa kuhonga ahabw'okweyendera; okuhiga oku yaahigire akuhikiirize, nk'ekiragiro ky'obunaziiri bwe oku kiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
